        <dc:description>&lt;p class="description"&gt;Warning: Contains 2,400 words of nasty beastman-on-girl action! Justice Mercy Butterfield is part of the world's secret magical police force, and an anti-beastmen bigot, prejudiced against werewolves, centaurs and other animalistic creatures of legend only she can't stop having hot sex with them! In this origin story short, a minotaur and a dogman show Mercy the beastsex she's been missing!&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Warning: Contains 2,400 words of nasty beastman-on-girl action!  &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Justice Mercy Butterfield is part of the world's secret magical police force, keeping the peace in the shadows! She's also an anti-beastmen bigot, prejudiced against werewolves, centaurs and other animalistic creatures of legend… except she can't stop having hot sex with them!  &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In this "origin story" short, meet Mercy — and discover how her passion for big beastly dicks got started, as a minotaur and a dogman show Mercy the beastsex she's been missing out on!&lt;/p&gt;</dc:description>
